id:                     E3510
title: 规范空白行定义与历史解析器诊断期望分别验收
trigger_tool: perl|make|parser
phase: testing|runtime-validation
error_signature: Not written yet whole-file skip|obsolete whitespace-only warning expectation
severity:               2
category:               compat, testing, parser
match_keywords: POD, whitespace, blank paragraph, normative oracle, deferred test, unknown directive
root_cause: 历史未实现测试的不可达诊断期望不能替代当前语言规范；空白行词法定义和实际错误指令拒绝需要分别由独立依据及实际API验证。
affected_scope: 规范空白行与历史解析诊断不一致的延期测试
verification_cmd: make -j1 test TEST_VERBOSE=1
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: independent-normative-positive-and-invalid-input-negative
rec_description: 核对当前受支持语言规范，绑定原始归档及fixture哈希；仅补全延期测试，保留独立非法输入及错误诊断；由官方工具生成单文件补丁，分别记录原始与适配测试哈希，再运行完整原测试、真实安装消费者和Harmony专项。
rec_command: make -j1 test TEST_VERBOSE=1
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: Keep original fixtures and parser module; complete one deferred source test and preserve exact invalid-input diagnostics.
